Package: vabaxos-print
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, cups-client, sane-utils
Recommends: cups, ipp-usb, sane-airscan, vabaxos-reader
Description: Printers and scanners, step by step and said aloud
 The printers found without drivers (IPP Everywhere, AirPrint) and the
 default one, Make default and Print a test page on each; the scanners,
 with Scan and read: the page is saved and the VabaxOS reader recognizes
 and reads its text. Keeps cups-browsed out (CVE-2024-47176): CUPS finds
 network printers through mDNS without it.
